---
title: Activity 1 - Patient Registration Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Admin or Doctor logs in]
    B --> C[Navigate to Create Patient]
    C --> D[Fill patient form\nname, dob, gender,\ncontact info, medical info]
    D --> E{Validation passes?}
    E -- No --> F[Show validation errors]
    F --> D
    E -- Yes --> G{User account exists\nfor patient?}
    G -- No --> H[Create User account\nwith role: pacijent]
    H --> I[Create Patient record\nlinked to User]
    G -- Yes --> I
    I --> J[Create PatientSocioeconomic\nrecord linked to Patient]
    J --> K[Redirect to Patient Detail page]
    K --> L([End])
